	(descr "Plug-ready motor land (D65, BetaFPV Matrix 1S 5IN1 II arrangement): 3 plated holes D0.50 (ring D0.90) at the Molex PicoBlade 1.25 mm pitch for an OPTIONAL vertical THT header Molex 53047-0310 (DNP by default, fitted from the back = header side, pins soldered on the front), and front solder areas for direct motor wires (no paste): pads 1/3 1.65 x 1.50, pad 2 0.90 x 1.50. +y = toward the board edge (header wall 1.20 from the pin row on that side). 3D model = Molex 53047-0310 (LCSC C122442 STEP; KiCad packages3D has no 53047 model) flipped about X, body under the board (offset z = -board thickness 1.049). Header datasheet: Molex SD-53047-xxx https://www.molex.com/pdm_docs/sd/530470310_sd.pdf")
